el=\"\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><!----><!----></div><div fxflex.gt-lg=\"50\"><mat-accordion class=\"mat-accordion faq__accordion\"><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-12 mat-expanded mat-expansion-panel-spacing ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-13 ng-tns-c1859850774-12 ng-animate-disabled mat-expanded mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"How do I file a baggage claim with Saudia?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-6\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-6\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-13\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-13\"> How do I file a baggage claim with Saudia? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-13 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-12 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-6\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-6\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-12\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>Passengers can submit a baggage claim online by completing the Baggage Compensation Form, providing their booking reference, last name, and ticket number.</p></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-14 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-15 ng-tns-c1859850774-14 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"What should I do if my baggage is delayed?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-7\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-7\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-15\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-15\"> What should I do if my baggage is delayed? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-15 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-14 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-7\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-7\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-14\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>If your baggage does not arrive at your destination, report it immediately at the airport or submit a delayed baggage claim online as soon as possible.</p></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-16 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-17 ng-tns-c1859850774-16 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Can I claim compensation for damaged baggage?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-8\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-8\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-17\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-17\"> Can I claim compensation for damaged baggage? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-17 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-16 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-8\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-8\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-16\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>Yes. Passengers may be eligible for compensation if their baggage is damaged during transport, subject to Saudia's baggage liability policy and claim requirements.</p></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-18 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-19 ng-tns-c1859850774-18 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"How can I track the status of my baggage claim?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-9\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-9\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-19\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-19\"> How can I track the status of my baggage claim? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-19 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-18 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-9\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-9\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-18\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>You can monitor the progress of your claim through Saudia's self-service baggage claim tools or by contacting customer support with your claim reference number.</p></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-20 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-21 ng-tns-c1859850774-20 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"What documents are required for a baggage claim?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-10\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-10\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-21\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-21\"> What documents are required for a baggage claim? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-21 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-20 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-10\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-10\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-20\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>To process a baggage claim, passengers may be asked to provide their ticket number, booking reference, baggage tags, proof of ownership, and supporting documents related to the incident.</p></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><!----></mat-accordion></div></div></div></div><!----></app-jss-faq><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}